1.callback hell (nested call back) : call back inside a lot of nested call backs and code becomes unmaintainable.grows horizontally,difficult to debug
2.inversion of control : we loss control of program because we pass that callback function into another function control and we giving control of Function to some other function and we don't know whether that function will ever execute callback or not so this invert of function is another function 

